{"name": "Mecha Force", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mecha Force, developed by Ming Studio, redefines mech games by blending immersive 3D cockpit gameplay with modern Roguelite elements. This first-person mech action game channels the passion for classic Japanese mecha anime into an unprecedented combat experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Command Your Mech to Resist Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the cockpit, synchronize with the \"Kylin\", and drive the giant mech into battle against mechanized enemies of varying forms. Experience pure mecha aesthetics through immersive combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize and Upgrade Your Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each sortie, you'll discover new weapon types, abundant upgrade options, diverse combat environments, and mysterious unknown powers that recreate those deja vu moments of brilliance in gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guided by the Enigmatic \"Maki\"</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Machineera\" connects with the \"Kylin\" through Neural Link as your navigator. This mysterious girl will fight alongside you, helping reclaim humanity's future with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Confront Terror in a Chaotic Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Now, pilot humanity's last hope - the mech \"Kylin\" - rallying all surviving forces to protect Earth's lifeforms and launch a counteroffensive against the alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.poster.avif?t=1776138468\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.webm?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.mp4?t=1776138468\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mecha Force is a first-person 3D action game that blends mecha elements with Roguelite features. You will act as the \"Correlator\", customizing and piloting your dedicated giant mech \"Kylin\" to stand against the alien invaders known as \"Dominators\", protect Earth, and reclaim humanity's future.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/2374bc89d0bf3c6466914f0745d9fcee606f4e53/header.jpg?t=1776138468", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Mechs", "Action RPG", "Singleplayer", "3D", "Roguelike", "Action"], "developers": "MING STUDIO", "publishers": "MING STUDIO", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4036130", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/wzkLWRggHq4", "first_seen": 1769040000.0, "review_rank": 1359}